*OVADR
RELOC OVRLCA

	-OVNUM


/THIS SECTION IS INVOKED WHEN A DOCUMENT HAS COMPLETED PRINTING AND A NEW
/ONE MUST BE TAKEN FROM THE QUEUE.

OVDONE=.-OVRLCA
OBDONE=OVTYPE+OVNUM

	DCA	PRYES	/RESET THE PRINT INHIBIT FLAG

			/RESET ALL CHARACTER ENHANCEMENTS	/A114	/C165
	JMS	PRESCS	/IN CASE THE NEXT PRINTER ACTIVITY IS 		/A114
		PCBOLD	/FROM ANOTHER SOURCE, SUCH AS CX, PRINT SCREEN	/A114
			/OR LIST PROCESSING				/A114


/SET THE WORD AND CHARACTER SPACE SIZES BACK TO THE DEFAULT PITCH IN CASE
/COMM USES THE PRINTER.  THIS SECTION IS SKIPPED IF PRINTING WAS STOPPED
/DUE TO A NON-EXISTENT PRINTER OR AN IN-USE COMM LINE.

	JMS	SKIPIF		/ SKIP IF				/A209
		LQPSE		/ LQPSE					/A209
	JMP	DONCL1	/   JMP TO LEAVE IT (FOR LQP02).		/A085
	TAD	PLNRCS							/M085
	JMS	PRESCS	/SET CHARACTER SPACE SIZE TO CURRENT PITCH
		PCCSIZ

	JMS	PRESCS	/SET WORD SPACE SIZE TO CURRENT PITCH
		PCWSIZ
