			/ WE MUST ALWAYS COME BACK THIS FAR AND CHECK	/A133
			/ TO SEE IF THE STATUS HAS BECOME 1 (ERROR FIXED/A133
			/ IF SO WE WILL NEED USER ACTION TO CONTINUE THE/A133
			/ JOB, SO WE MUST CHANGE TO A USER STOP TO LET	/A133
			/ HIM KNOW.					/A133
			/ RELATED TO SL DOING A STOP FOR THE USER	/A133
	AC7777		/ IS THERE AN ERROR STATUS?			/A054
