/  1.  WPCUT IF A STOP ACTION WAS SPECIFIED AND THE STOP FLAG DID	/A191
/	NOT CLEAR WITHIN A REASONABLE TIME.  SETTING THE ABORT FLAG	/A191
/	MAY GET THE SPOOLER OUT OF THE PRLOOP BY DISCARDING CHARACTERS	/A191
/	TO THE END OF THE LINE, SO THE STOP FLAG CAN BE SEEN AND THE	/A191
/	STOP OVERLAY WILL THEN BE REACHED.  SUCH A CONDITION IS TYPICAL	/A191
