/									/A191
/	THE PROBLEM IS WORSE IN LIST PROCESSING SINCE THE PRINTER	/A191
/	STATUS MESSAGE DOES NOT APPEAR ON THE SCREEN			/A191
/									/A191
/  2.	WPEDOV IN LIST PROCESSING IF GOLD HALT IS HIT			/A191

