/CALCULATE THE LARGEST RIGHT MARGIN TO DATE IN THIS COLUMN

	TAD	RULRT1	/GET THE RIGHT MARGIN
	DCA	RULRRM	/SAVE AS THE RIGHT MARGIN

	TAD	RULRRM	/GET CURRENT RIGHT MARGIN SIZE
	CIA
	TAD	PRMCLL	/COMPARE WITH LARGEST LINE TO DATE
	SMA CLA
	JMP	PRO2L2	/NO NEED TO UPDATE

	TAD	RULRRM	/UPDATE NEW LARGEST LINE
	DCA	PRMCLL
	JMP	PRO2L2

