	TAD	PRYES	/SEE IF PRINTING IS ENABLED
	SZA CLA
	JMP	TOPPL6	/NO--CONTINUE WITH TOP OF HEADER CODE

/OTHERWISE, DO THE STOP PROCESSING FOR THE TOP OF PAGE.
	JMP	TOPSE							/A177
