/		OR CX), AS WELL AS THE PRINTER ITSELF.  THEREFORE ANY	/
/		JWAITS IT CONTAINS MAY NOT BE SHARED WITH OTHER JOBS	/
/		THUS WE CANNOT USE THE SAME SUBROUTINE THE PRINTER JOB	/
/		USES AS IT MAY BE IN USE BY THE PRINTER JOB		/
/									/
/		(IT USED TO AND DID CAUSE A SYSTEM HANG)	/A198	/
/									/
/***********************************************************************/

